      "sourceHash": "c96070f1de49b65369f726a2ad7eaf8c356565c8aaeee72f914a2d237b45b751",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 7.28,
          "en": "We're almost done with this first course module where we have a look at some of the basics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.28,
          "end": 9.26,
          "en": "By the way, you can ignore these warnings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.26,
          "end": 11.54,
          "en": "We'll tackle them, handle them later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.93,
          "end": 17.15,
          "en": "For now, I want to conclude this module by also putting the button into a separate component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.18,
          "end": 20.81,
          "en": "Basically for the same reason I did it with the text input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.84,
          "end": 25.94,
          "en": "I want to be able to simply throw in my custom button and have all the styling and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.94,
          "end": 27.46,
          "en": "Sit inside of that button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.47,
          "end": 32.72,
          "en": "Of course we could set up a global button style, but if I ever want to use a different style in a different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.72,
          "end": 35.57,
          "en": "place, then I would have to double override it and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.57,
          "end": 39.2,
          "en": "So I'll just go for a custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 39.8,
          "end": 45.92,
          "en": "So let's add a button dot svelte file here again in the UI folder because it's not meetup specific.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 45.95,
          "end": 51.56,
          "en": "And in that button component here, we want to have the general button markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.86,
          "end": 54.92,
          "en": "Now that markup is not too difficult.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 54.92,
          "end": 56.75,
          "en": "Of course it's just button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 57.29,
          "end": 61.28,
          "en": "And in there, in between, I want to output some text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 61.28,
          "end": 65.12,
          "en": "So let's add a script tag here and expect some props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 65.12,
          "end": 72.95,
          "en": "For example, the button type, but also the caption and the caption is what we can print between the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 72.98,
          "end": 74,
          "en": "button tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 74.06,
          "end": 79.58,
          "en": "The type can be set here on the button on the type attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 79.7,
          "end": 83.84,
          "en": "Now for the styling, again, let's add style, text and attach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 83.84,
          "end": 87.59,
          "en": "Now you find the styles for this button, you can just copy and paste them in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 87.68,
          "end": 91.52,
          "en": "There are some redundant styles in there which will become important later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 92.02000000000001,
          "end": 96.19,
          "en": "For now, let's grab all these styles as they are attached and add them here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 96.2,
          "end": 98.81,
          "en": "With that, we should have a button that is ready to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 98.81,
          "end": 103.00999999999999,
          "en": "If you now go to app svelte you can import that button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 103.00999999999999,
          "end": 114.02000000000001,
          "en": "So import button from dot slash UI buttons svelte and instead of the button down there here at the bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 114.25999999999999,
          "end": 116.78,
          "en": "we can now use our own button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 116.78,
          "end": 118.56,
          "en": "It works a bit differently though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 118.59,
          "end": 119.91,
          "en": "Type is set to submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 125.67,
          "en": "It's now self-closing and we set a caption instead of passing the text inside of the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 125.67,
          "end": 130.8,
          "en": "We'll later change this actually, because there is a way of passing data between the opening and closing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 130.83,
          "end": 131.4,
          "en": "tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 131.4,
          "end": 133.05,
          "en": "But we haven't learned about this yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 133.05,
          "end": 137.76,
          "en": "So for now, let's use a prop and let's name this save.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 138.43,
          "end": 140.82999999999998,
          "en": "If we save that this is the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 140.82999999999998,
          "end": 141.99,
          "en": "Doesn't look too bad.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 142,
          "end": 145.34,
          "en": "And with that, we're almost there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 145.36,
          "end": 148.3,
          "en": "Let's now also use the button in our cards here, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 148.3,
          "end": 150.64,
          "en": "So in our meetup items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 150.64,
          "end": 154,
          "en": "And that is already an advantage of having it in a separate component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 154.03,
          "end": 161.5,
          "en": "Now all we have to do is in the meetup item component we can import button from.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 162.29,
          "end": 163.32,
          "en": "Going up one level.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 163.34,
          "end": 165.68,
          "en": "The folder button, svelte.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 165.71,
          "end": 169.82,
          "en": "And now in the places where we have buttons here, show details and favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 169.85,
          "end": 178.1,
          "en": "We use a button type button with a caption of show details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 178.78,
          "end": 180.43,
          "en": "And favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 180.43,
          "end": 185.91,
          "en": "And now, last but not least, let's also make sure the anchor tag looks good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 185.92,
          "end": 188.44,
          "en": "And for this we can even use a button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 188.65,
          "end": 190.33,
          "en": "Self-Closing button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 190.33,
          "end": 193.69,
          "en": "Let's set a href of male to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 194.45,
          "end": 198.77,
          "en": "And then that was email here and a caption of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 200.14,
          "end": 201.31,
          "en": "Contact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 201.43,
          "end": 206.41,
          "en": "And now let's just make sure that the anchor tag gets rendered instead of a button when we do have that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 206.41,
          "end": 207.64,
          "en": "href attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 207.79,
          "end": 210.76,
          "en": "For this, we can simply go into that button component again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 211.68,
          "end": 219.87,
          "en": "Expect ref as a prop and now we can render different markup here depending on whether ref is set or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 219.87,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 222.25,
          "end": 225.22,
          "en": "If ref is set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 225.99,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "Then I want to render an anchor tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 229.5,
          "end": 231.15,
          "en": "Else I'll render my button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 231.15,
          "end": 232.59,
          "en": "And here at the end, we close.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 232.59,
          "end": 233.18,
          "en": "If.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 233.19,
          "end": 238.14,
          "en": "So here we have an anchor tag and we set href equal to href here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 238.14,
          "end": 240.45,
          "en": "And in between we output our caption.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 241.48,
          "end": 246.76,
          "en": "Now, if we go back we have our buttons here to contact should be written.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 247.85,
          "end": 249.59,
          "en": "Uppercase like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 250.7,
          "end": 252.41,
          "en": "And now we have our nice buttons here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 253.65,
          "end": 259.47,
          "en": "Now, if we want to have some different buttons that don't all look the same, we can again go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 259.47,
          "end": 262.98,
          "en": "to the button component and add some flexibility there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 263.1,
          "end": 264.63,
          "en": "We can add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 266.38,
          "end": 269.3,
          "en": "For example, a mode here, and you can name this whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 269.32,
          "end": 270.52,
          "en": "I will name it mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 271.15,
          "end": 273.07,
          "en": "It's simply a new prop, which I accept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 273.07,
          "end": 279.97,
          "en": "And now we can add some additional styles which are in the second CSS file you find attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 280.09000000000003,
          "end": 284.86,
          "en": "Simply grab those and add them after the existing styles here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 284.89,
          "end": 287.2,
          "en": "There are also some redundant ones for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 288.19,
          "end": 293.5,
          "en": "You can now go down to button and now I want to add some CSS classes conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 293.5,
          "end": 297.97,
          "en": "So I'll add class here and I will add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 299.33,
          "end": 301.32,
          "en": "Mode as a class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 301.37,
          "end": 302.57,
          "en": "Now, what's the idea here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 302.6,
          "end": 306.86,
          "en": "Well, mode for for the moment can be set to outline.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 306.89,
          "end": 312.38,
          "en": "Then this button will have an outline class and I added some styles that will style the button differently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 312.38,
          "end": 314.78,
          "en": "if an outline class is set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 314.96,
          "end": 321.98,
          "en": "So now in meetup item we could go to favorite for example, maybe move that in between contact and show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 321.98,
          "end": 322.76,
          "en": "details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 323.33,
          "end": 327.17,
          "en": "And now add to the favorite button mode outline.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 327.47,
          "end": 330.17,
          "en": "If you do that looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 330.36,
          "end": 332.42,
          "en": "That's just mixing it up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 332.42,
          "end": 335.51,
          "en": "And of course we can fine tune this way more.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 335.51,
